      "text": "Used when an image is built – existing images and their VMs keep what they were built with (language, keyboard …); build an image again to take a change. The default credential is set on the Credentials page, the default look in the Looks tab. \"Like this computer\" uses this computer's values. The lists offer only what both NixOS and macOS VMs support. Your SSH keys from ~/.ssh are added automatically. A developer flake's local/settings.nix overrides these values."
